therly direction.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.441,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-31-16"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1030015","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"6b71cf9f75f7a8dc646b2b1507f42ff4cfb144a5dfe76193eed157847d945b98","compact":"f460cf9a63c79a558c515a0c231f833cf235dec67c2f3810bcd0065a39d9f220","nasal":"f460cf9a63c79a558c515a0c231f833cf235dec67c2f3810bcd0065a39d9f220"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-30-16","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":30,"verse":16,"english":"And as that best of ascetics proceeded, he was followed by Brāhmaṇas, unholding the Veda, carrying the sacrificial necessaries on an hundred cars.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-31-17"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1030016","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"dd3e882fe237bd810b92fe6d1bb78fb8429694ab68f1e10bb046f0f1c95d29c9","compact":"a8c6a5bb471881c1199398d920ecc1bdbc5a608e40ea79fb2fdc974bb53732b2","nasal":"a4a593221fcb2b2fe65f28c930ddad82c614fb54129377d4fda67991c37b8223"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-30-17","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":30,"verse":17,"english":"And birds and beasts dwelling in Siddhāśrama followed the high-souled Viśvāmitra having asceticism for wealth.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.866,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-31-18"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1030017","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"00cf28d82db0262183020dc45a927f8cee8fbc3d7a860b32d530cf30a3218f04","compact":"60f8a5e8c98de6f9c8a92f751aa0f91f24dd8ef0359ccd4d93a9a79b6437a48a","nasal":"60f8a5e8c98de6f9c8a92f751aa0f91f24dd8ef0359ccd4d93a9a79b6437a48a"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-30-18","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":30,"verse":18,"english":"Having proceeded a 